WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Customize an invoice in Fullbleed's free
HTML and CSS playground.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.760
Open the playground. Choose Northstar
invoice.

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:14.480
Change the recipient from Maple & Finch to
Willow & Finch.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:22.200
Add a CSS rule to change the invoice
heading color.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:30.240
Choose Render PDF to preview the new
recipient and heading color.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:34.600
Choose Download PDF to save the finished
invoice.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:42.240
Choose Node.js, then Download project to
keep the editable source.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:50.240
Extract the Node.js ZIP. Run npm ci
--ignore-scripts, then npm run render.
